[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + i(4(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta) + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m \]
