[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + (300\sin\theta + 468\cos\theta)i + 24\cos\theta - 36\sin\theta - (24\sin\theta - 36\cos\theta)i.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=270964)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
